  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 100,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Observability Data Quality Operator Guide",
      "description": "Action guide for scrape target health and metric availability. No Data means Prometheus cannot reach the exporter — check job configuration and network.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [],
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Observability / Data Quality\n\nThis dashboard diagnoses **when evidence is missing** — before assuming a metric zero means everything is fine.\n\n**Scrape target triage order:**\n1. Check `Visible Targets vs Expected` — is the count below 7?\n2. Check `Up Targets vs Visible` — is a visible target down (`up=0`)?\n3. Check `Missing Target Detection` — which job is absent?\n4. Check `Down Target Detection` — which job is present but failing?\n\n**Key distinction:**\n- `up=0`: target is registered in Prometheus but scrape is failing.\n- Absent series: target was never registered or was removed from scrape config.\n\n**Expected critical target count: 7** (gateway + risk-adapter + 3x vllm-runtimes + dcgm-exporter + cadvisor)\n\n**When this dashboard shows a problem, Serving Home verdict will show OBSERVABILITY DEGRADED.**\n"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Visible Targets vs Expected",
      "description": "Healthy: visible count equals 7 expected. Attention: below 7 means a target is missing or never registered. No Data: Prometheus up series absent — Prometheus may not be running. The expected critical target count is projected from gateway + risk-adapter + vLLM runtime targets + dcgm + cadvisor.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(up{job=~\"gateway|risk-adapter|vllm-runtimes|dcgm-exporter|cadvisor\"})",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "visible"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "No Target Series",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {"color": "red", "value": null},
              {"color": "orange", "value": 5},
              {"color": "green", "value": 7}
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Up Targets vs Visible",
      "description": "Healthy: up count equals visible count. Attention: up count below visible count means a registered target is failing its scrape. No Data: Prometheus up series absent. The expected critical target count is projected from gateway + risk-adapter + vLLM runtime targets + dcgm + cadvisor.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 4,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(up{job=~\"gateway|risk-adapter|vllm-runtimes|dcgm-exporter|cadvisor\"})",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "up"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "No Target Series",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {"color": "red", "value": null},
              {"color": "orange", "value": 5},
              {"color": "green", "value": 7}
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Missing Critical Targets",
      "description": "Healthy: 0 missing targets means all 7 expected targets are visible. Attention: any missing target means Prometheus config or service discovery is incomplete. No Data: ai_missing_critical_targets recording rule absent — check if recording rules are loaded.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "ai_missing_critical_targets",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "missing"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "Recording Rule Absent",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {"color": "green", "value": null},
              {"color": "orange", "value": 1},
              {"color": "red", "value": 3}
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Gateway Metric Availability",
      "description": "Healthy: gateway up=1. Attention: up=0 means target registered but scrape failing — check bearer token and /metrics endpoint. No Data: gateway target absent from Prometheus — check scrape config.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
